# Orbital dogfooding: the curated roadmap file BACKLOG.md IS tracked; its
# spec/diagram working dir BACKLOG/ stays local. (!BACKLOG.md is defensive —
# nothing above matches it today, but it guards against a future BACKLOG* rule.)
BACKLOG/
!BACKLOG.md

