# Working screenshots not referenced by README (keep only README-used images
# tracked). Naming files one by one let 20 unreferenced images accumulate, so
# scratch capture dirs are now excluded wholesale and loose media at the repo
# root — never a README path, always a working artifact — is excluded too.
docs/screenshots/i18n/
docs/screenshots/daemon-installed-only.png
docs/screenshots/merged-subagents.png
docs/screenshots/phase3-rendered-stream.png
